  unitName: Light Nymph
  unitId: 50120
  unitNumber: 175
  description: A small nymph thought to be born from light, one of the six elements
    made by the gods. It's mischievous and likes startling travelers in the dark
    with a blinding light. It's popular with Summoners for its ability to give special
    powers to others, but it hates being captured and only goes along with those
    it likes. There are also unvalidated rumors that it can be malicious at times.
  summonDesc: I am a Light Nymph, pew!<br>You seem interesting.<br>Lemme go with
    you, pew!
